Z||000019||Tigger||10-16-2000||10:47 AM||||These pictures might be of a prototype made by the kit manufacturer.  The smoked out glass could mean it's a "slammer," just body & wheels but I doubt it.  Tight door seams like those take a lot of work to make right, but they are possible.  It also looks like the door opens from the black belt line up.  I guess you need to step into it, but that's ok.<P>The picture below is faked...  It's actually an '84 SE  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">           <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
