Z||000021||stsmithgt||10-16-2000||12:23 PM||||With the light color of the car and the digital image.  Tight seems can be an illusion.  A cheap graphics card in your computor can make it seamless.  There was probably more than one Wraith car made to make the movie so some of them may have looked very fake like this one sort of does.  If this one was made to view only, it may have had lots of attention put into it's appearance which can make it look fake.  It probably doesn't have an engine or half the interior functions in it(if it's "real")I've seen a lot of cars at car shows that look very "fake". SO THERE!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Put that in your hat and think about it.||||reg||12
